      "trajectory": [
        {
          "@type": "EmotionProfile",
          "position": 1,
          "segmentText": "# EP1-2 — 非分離コードと図書館（潜航）\n- POV: 私（Tamaki／環樹）\n- Beat: Dive / Confrontation / Trigger\n\n意識が形を取り戻すと、私はライブラリの踊り場に立っていた。天まで届く書架。砕けたデータクリスタル。中央には一行のエラー。",
          "emotionVector": [
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "joy",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "sadness",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "fear",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "anger",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "surprise",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "trust",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "anticipation",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "disgust",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "relief",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "hope",
              "score": 0
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "@type": "EmotionProfile",
          "position": 2,
          "segmentText": "// LOGICAL PARADOX: TRUST == ERROR\n\nEliasの孤独は、論理でできていた。正しさが堆積して壁になり、呼吸の入り口を塞いでいる。私はNei-chanから受け取った非分離のコードを展開し、渦の中心へと投げ入れる。境界をほどく語彙は、たいてい優しい声色をしている。",
          "emotionVector": [
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "sadness",
              "score": 1
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "joy",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "fear",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "anger",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "surprise",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "trust",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "anticipation",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "disgust",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "relief",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "hope",
              "score": 0
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "@type": "EmotionProfile",
          "position": 3,
          "segmentText": "反発は即時だった。影が現れ、胸に真空を押しつけてくる。視界がスタティックで雪のように荒れ、膝が揺れる。遠くでKaedeの声。「Tamaki、戻って」\n\n戻らない——じゃなくて、戻りながら進む。私は一度、呼吸のリズムを「いい感じ」に合わせる。恐れに寄らない。恐れは視野を狭め、丁寧さを奪うから。",
          "emotionVector": [
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "fear",
              "score": 1
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "joy",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "sadness",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "anger",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "surprise",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "trust",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "anticipation",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "disgust",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "relief",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "hope",
              "score": 0
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "@type": "EmotionProfile",
          "position": 4,
          "segmentText": "「Hibiki、準備を」\n「合図して」\n\n私は渦の核に掌を重ね、そっと名を外す。「孤独」とは呼ばない。ただ、痛みと呼ぶ。名を変えると、対象の硬度が少しだけ変わる。",
          "emotionVector": [
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "sadness",
              "score": 0.5455
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "anticipation",
              "score": 0.4545
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "joy",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "fear",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "anger",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "surprise",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "trust",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "disgust",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "relief",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "hope",
              "score": 0
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "@type": "EmotionProfile",
          "position": 5,
          "segmentText": "「今」\n原色が奔り、アヤワスカが空間の結び目を解体する。ページが蝶になって舞い、影は輪郭を失って光に還る。私は体を起こし、静けさの中でただ在った。いい感じが、戻ってくる。",
          "emotionVector": [
            {
