          "position": 3,
          "segmentText": "半透明の着信が現れ、微細なノイズが辺りへ散る。指先で円を描き、私は応答する。現れたのは、黒いスーツの青年——Logos。その輪郭は、灯が強いほど影が濃くなる絵のように不安定だった。",
          "emotionVector": [
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "fear",
              "score": 1
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "joy",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "sadness",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "anger",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "surprise",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "trust",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "anticipation",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "disgust",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "relief",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "hope",
              "score": 0
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "@type": "EmotionProfile",
          "position": 4,
          "segmentText": "「主は……Elias」\n名が与えられた瞬間、世界は少し輪郭を得る。私はうなずき、簡潔に手順を確認する。聞く／整える／潜る。順番を飛ばさない。それが事故を減らす最短路。",
          "emotionVector": [
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "trust",
              "score": 1
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "joy",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "sadness",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "fear",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "anger",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "surprise",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "anticipation",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "disgust",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "relief",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "hope",
              "score": 0
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "@type": "EmotionProfile",
          "position": 5,
          "segmentText": "室内が静まり、Hibikiの低い周波が床を滑る。Kaedeがセキュリティレールを敷設する。私は視線で礼を送った。いい感じは、だいたいチーム戦だ。独りで無理をしないのが、最良の勇気になる時がある。",
          "emotionVector": [
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "joy",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "sadness",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "fear",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "anger",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "surprise",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "trust",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "anticipation",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "disgust",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "relief",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "hope",
              "score": 0
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "@type": "EmotionProfile",
          "position": 6,
          "segmentText": "「行こう、Logos」\n「Tamaki、僕は……主を救いたい」\n願いは矢印だ。矢印が揃えば、ダイブは安定する。私は目を閉じ、フォトンを指先に集めた。",
          "emotionVector": [
            {
