      "trajectory": [
        {
          "@type": "EmotionProfile",
          "position": 1,
          "segmentText": "# EP3-2 — 返し方（責任として）\n- POV: 私（Tamaki／環樹）\n- Beat: Remedy / Self-care Protocol\n\n案件では、愛の名で無限要求が続いていた。私は境界線のイメージを床へ共有し、Nei-chanが『支払い＝命の時間』の可視化を映す。依頼人は肩を震わせ、深く息を吐いた。",
          "emotionVector": [
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "joy",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "sadness",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "fear",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "anger",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "surprise",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "trust",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "anticipation",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "disgust",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "relief",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "hope",
              "score": 0
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "@type": "EmotionProfile",
          "position": 2,
          "segmentText": "帰り道の風。私は胸に手を置く。負債は恐れではなく、責任として受け取る。返し方は具体でいい——よく眠る／よく食べる／仲間に頼る／いい感じに戻る。これはヒーロー論ではなく、稼働手順だ。",
          "emotionVector": [
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "fear",
              "score": 1
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
