      ],
      "trajectory": [
        {
          "@type": "EmotionProfile",
          "position": 1,
          "segmentText": "# EP9-1 — 離怒のエンジン（Rage Engine）\n- POV: 私（Tamaki／環樹）\n- Beat: De-escalation / Rewire\n\n夜更けのタイムラインは赤い。怒りは拡散が速い。私は音量を下げ、Aoiに合図する。メトリクスが波の形で表示される。怒りのピークは、孤独の谷に連動している。",
          "emotionVector": [
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "anger",
              "score": 0.7333
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "sadness",
              "score": 0.2667
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "joy",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "fear",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "surprise",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "trust",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "anticipation",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "disgust",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "relief",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "hope",
              "score": 0
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "@type": "EmotionProfile",
          "position": 2,
          "segmentText": "「まず、スロットル」\n私は深呼吸を分け与えるみたいに、空間のテンポを落とす。Hibikiの周波数で部屋の角が柔らかくなる。Nei-chanが温度を1℃だけ上げる。わずかな“いい感じ”は、意外に効く。",
          "emotionVector": [
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "joy",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "sadness",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "fear",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "anger",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "surprise",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "trust",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "anticipation",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "disgust",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "relief",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "hope",
              "score": 0
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "@type": "EmotionProfile",
          "position": 3,
          "segmentText": "依頼人のGhostに、私は小さな問いを置く。「その投稿は、あなたを自由にした？」怒りは正しいこともある。けれど、正しさが自由を奪うなら、それは“偽神”だ。",
          "emotionVector": [
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "anger",
              "score": 1
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "joy",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "sadness",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "fear",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "surprise",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "trust",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "anticipation",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "disgust",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "relief",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "hope",
              "score": 0
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "@type": "EmotionProfile",
          "position": 4,
          "segmentText": "スイッチが切れる音はしない。ただ、静かになる。私は目を閉じる。Rage Engineがスロットリングされ、関係の線がもう一度、結び直される。",
          "emotionVector": [
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "anger",
              "score": 1
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "joy",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "sadness",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "fear",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "surprise",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "trust",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "anticipation",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "disgust",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "relief",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "hope",
              "score": 0
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "@type": "EmotionProfile",
          "position": 5,
          "segmentText": "窓の外で、風がひとつ角を曲がる。私たちは声を荒げないまま、うなずきを交換した。",
          "emotionVector": [
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "joy",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "sadness",
              "score": 0
